WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.041
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.041 --> 00:00:03.874
- [Carmen] The day I was going to

00:00:03.874 --> 00:00:05.667
sign my papers to start working,

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.733
there were 3,000 inmates
out there working iron

00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:10.066
and I was like..

00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:13.755
What did I get myself into here?

00:00:21.386 --> 00:00:22.795
My name is Carmen Shehorn.

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:26.196
I'm the career technical
educator for cosmetology

00:00:26.196 --> 00:00:28.055
at Valley State Prison For Men.

00:00:28.055 --> 00:00:30.303
When I tell people that I
work teaching cosmetology

00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:31.236
in a men's prison,

00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:33.088
a lot of people are shocked
by it, they're surprised.

00:00:33.088 --> 00:00:35.992
They didn't even think
that it was available.

00:00:35.992 --> 00:00:38.348
This program takes approximately two years

00:00:38.348 --> 00:00:40.547
and they have to have 1600 hours completed

00:00:40.547 --> 00:00:43.739
in order to take the state board exam.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:45.743
There is a waiting list
to get into this class

00:00:45.743 --> 00:00:49.065
and in order to get into this
class, an inmate has to meet

00:00:49.065 --> 00:00:52.917
certain behavioral and
educational standards.

00:00:52.917 --> 00:00:55.259
You come into my class and
we're gonna treat each other

00:00:55.259 --> 00:00:56.843
with respect and common courtesy,

00:00:56.843 --> 00:01:00.106
and there's no boundaries in here.

00:01:00.106 --> 00:01:03.129
- We're just gonna relax
your facial muscles,

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.818
and improve your blood
flow throughout your face.

00:01:05.818 --> 00:01:07.430
My name is Juan Brizuela.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.064
I'm here at Valley State Prison
in Chowchilla California.

00:01:10.064 --> 00:01:12.585
My favorite part of the class
is the skin care part of it

00:01:12.585 --> 00:01:16.066
which includes the facials,
eyebrows and make up.

00:01:16.066 --> 00:01:19.741
I like to see my clients relax
and get comfortable with me.

00:01:19.741 --> 00:01:22.920
It's real personal and being in prison,

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.538
they teach you not to touch each other,

00:01:24.538 --> 00:01:25.642
not to touch staff.

00:01:25.642 --> 00:01:26.947
It goes against the norm of what

00:01:26.947 --> 00:01:28.974
people see about prison on TV,

00:01:28.974 --> 00:01:30.668
you know, ex-gang members,

00:01:30.668 --> 00:01:32.744
men with tattoos on their face,

00:01:32.744 --> 00:01:35.471
all over their body is not
something you see out there

00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:37.833
working in a beauty salon.

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:39.508
It's putting a lot on a different side

00:01:39.508 --> 00:01:42.059
of the prison system.

00:01:42.059 --> 00:01:43.442
- I do treat them as human beings.

00:01:43.442 --> 00:01:44.981
And I'm not here to punish them,

00:01:44.981 --> 00:01:47.352
I just here to show them
a skill that I have,

00:01:47.352 --> 00:01:50.257
and it happens to be in a prison.

00:01:50.257 --> 00:01:52.388
I have more empathy for people now,

00:01:52.388 --> 00:01:53.978
because of doing this type of work.

00:01:53.978 --> 00:01:56.273
When they get their license,
it's like I've gotten

00:01:56.273 --> 00:01:59.111
my license for the first
time all over again.

00:01:59.111 --> 00:02:00.778
It's very rewarding.

